Error [jet.OwnerMovedWhileViewed]: `right` cannot be changed by `.push()` while `selected` is still looking into it
  --> tests/ui/ownership/recursive_view_summaries_converge_to_every_possible_owner.jet:22:5
    |
 22 |     right.push(11)
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: `selected` is a live read view into `right[…]`; changing or moving the owner could invalidate that view
 Fix: Finish using `selected` before changing `right`, narrow the view's scope, or make an owned copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0212
